{"parentUuid":"ca90d8ee-b640-4ab1-9281-ad8ed4b5c9ee","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"5ddcd530-bad6-4373-adf1-fd1c31fd5a01","agentId":"a762a63df072879b5","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01H9qsLWaRpXmBM7JYuHZXfN","type":"tool_result","content":"# Multiecuscan Paddle Shifter Configuration Details\n\n**Module:** Body (BCM)\n\n**Menu Path:** Body → CAN Setup\n\n**Byte & Bits:** \"Byte 156, bits 4-5 (need to do bitwise calculation)\"\n\n**Before/After Values:**\n- NA version: \"xx01xxxx\"\n- Euro version: \"xx00xxxx\"\n\n**Configuration Logic:** The setting controls shift behavior from Park/Reverse to Drive, with the Euro variant allowing the minus paddle combined with plus to shift into Neutral.\n\n**PROXI Alignment:** Required after changes\n\n**Prerequisites:** Access to Multiecuscan software and OBD2 connection\n\n**Author & Date:** FizzGiGG, April 5, 2024\n\n**Reversibility:** The change is reversible by restoring the original byte value, though the author recommends \"save this PROXI data to a text file for ease of restore if you happen to mess something up.\"\n\n**Risks:** Noted as potentially serious—\"Pay close attention and only alter what you are attempting to alter as these settings can have dire consequences if changed unknowingly.\""}]},"uuid":"80a29490-806d-4e6d-8ff3-886d1dbc6619","timestamp":"2026-10-14T11:11:45.009Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":73422,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# Multiecuscan Paddle Shifter Configuration Details\n\n**Module:** Body (BCM)\n\n**Menu Path:** Body → CAN Setup\n\n**Byte & Bits:** \"Byte 156, bits 4-5 (need to do bitwise calculation)\"\n\n**Before/After Values:**\n- NA version: \"xx01xxxx\"\n- Euro version: \"xx00xxxx\"\n\n**Configuration Logic:** The setting controls shift behavior from Park/Reverse to Drive, with the Euro variant allowing the minus paddle combined with plus to shift into Neutral.\n\n**PROXI Alignment:** Required after changes\n\n**Prerequisites:** Access to Multiecuscan software and OBD2 connection\n\n**Author & Date:** FizzGiGG, April 5, 2024\n\n**Reversibility:** The change is reversible by restoring the original byte value, though the author recommends \"save this PROXI data to a text file for ease of restore if you happen to mess something up.\"\n\n**Risks:** Noted as potentially serious—\"Pay close attention and only alter what you are attempting to alter as these settings can have dire consequences if changed unknowingly.\"","durationMs":4114,"url":"https://giuliatech.com/t/multiecuscan-mes-popular-settings-compilation/80"},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"e4de536b-f52e-49ef-8155-9207594cae00","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/c/Users/User/mcp-servers","root":null,"branch":null,"default_branch":null,"status":null,"visibility":null,"error":"pending"},"live_cwd":"/c/Users/User/mcp-servers","platform":"windows"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ca90d8ee-b640-4ab1-9281-ad8ed4b5c9ee","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf-b34b-9eb82aebbf17","version":"2.1.282","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-splashing-comet"}
